@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Creating a Microsoft Azure Account";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="text-center text-primary">Creating a Microsoft Azure Account</h1>
    <p class="lead text-center">Follow this step-by-step guide to create a Microsoft Azure account and start exploring cloud services.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Step 1: Visit the Azure Website -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">Step 1: Visit the Microsoft Azure Website</h2>
        <p>Go to the official Microsoft Azure website by visiting <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com" target="_blank">Azure Portal</a>. Click on the "Start free" button to begin the registration process.</p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-homepage.jpg" alt="Azure Homepage" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Microsoft Azure homepage where you can sign up.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Sign in or Create a Microsoft Account -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Step 2: Sign in or Create a Microsoft Account</h2>
        <p>Use an existing Microsoft account to sign in, or create a new one. This account will be used to access Azure services.</p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/microsoft-signin.jpg" alt="Microsoft Account Sign In" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Sign in or create a Microsoft account.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Provide Personal and Billing Information -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Step 3: Provide Personal and Billing Information</h2>
        <p>Enter the required details such as name, address, and payment information. Microsoft provides a free trial with $200 credit for 30 days.</p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-billing.jpg" alt="Azure Billing Information" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Enter your personal and billing details.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: Verify Identity -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Step 4: Verify Your Identity</h2>
        <p>Microsoft will ask for identity verification via phone number and credit card (no charges will be made).</p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-verification.jpg" alt="Azure Verification Process" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Identity verification ensures security and prevents misuse.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 5: Accept Terms and Start Using Azure -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Step 5: Accept Terms and Start Using Azure</h2>
        <p>Review the terms and conditions, accept them, and click on "Get Started" to access the Azure portal.</p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-dashboard.jpg" alt="Azure Dashboard" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure portal dashboard where you can manage cloud resources.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>Once your account is created, you can start deploying and managing cloud resources. Explore Azure services such as Virtual Machines, Databases, and AI tools.</p>
        <p class="text-center">Happy Cloud Computing!</p>
    </div>
</div>
